{"overview":"A new bride has made a batch of biscuits. Her husband pretends to like them, so she delivers the rest to his office. But one bite of these biscuits makes you violently ill, and soon all his visitors (he runs a theatrical booking agency), plus the workmen at home, are ill; when she shows up at the office, they all go after her.","cast":[{"n":"John R. Cumpson","c":"Mr. Jones","p":"/gIEJcb9Yb6J4FxmvU9NOEcmv3hn.jpg","q":"Q3182329"},{"n":"Florence Lawrence","c":"Mrs. Jones","p":"/gpjntjA0Kbit4MUcPMM4KBLicpw.jpg","q":"Q256968"},{"n":"Linda Arvidson","c":"","p":"/pxNBQP2W90PyV69sjH3CRvXL2O4.jpg","q":"Q2710971"},{"n":"Mary Pickford","c":"Biscuit Victim","p":"/4UaErdt3KcNhObDmxRbWKvHxt6x.jpg","q":"Q104109"},{"n":"Mack Sennett","c":"Biscuit Victim","p":"/24XTSL0AbuT6gzjqAFhpc4fkEts.jpg","q":"Q317574"},{"n":"Marion Leonard","c":"Biscuit Victim","p":"/ftSUgK4P92cPUOMGl3LLeFbdBan.jpg","q":"Q1748192"},{"n":"Violet Mersereau","c":"Biscuit Victim","p":"/q9mh4kaKAmn5nJpBycbLXZXar2z.jpg","q":"Q217628"},{"n":"Arthur V. Johnson","c":"Biscuit Victim","p":"/lmhYKDRrZeqcZg7FQUmyEoLLqoo.jpg","q":"Q661079"},{"n":"Jeanie Macpherson","c":"Secretary","p":"/nulmuZe4m0edGINH1Me5ix0Ivsl.jpg","q":"Q452602"},{"n":"Charles Avery","c":"Biscuit Victim","p":"/jusDHfvZ1jfzF9wNoeZ3DtIuQrJ.jpg","q":"Q354603"}],"country":["United States"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Her_First_Biscuits","qid":"Q1881171","rel":{"US":{"d":"1909-06-17"}},"stills":["silent-her-first-biscuits_1.webp","silent-her-first-biscuits_2.webp","silent-her-first-biscuits_3.webp","silent-her-first-biscuits_4.webp"]}